    <h1>Why Women Over 45 Are Switching to a Magnesium Gummy With the Dose on the Front. Here&#39;s 7 Reasons Why.</h1>
    <div class="av-by"><span class="av-av">m</span><p>Written by <b>Sara</b>,<br>founder of Mëva</p></div>
    <blockquote class="av-q">&ldquo;Read this <b>BEFORE</b> you buy another magnesium supplement!&rdquo;</blockquote>

    <div class="av-tbl">
